    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery Auctioneers are delighted to welcome you to 15 Renmore Road, a substantial residence ideally positioned overlooking a large park in one of Galway`s most sought-after and well-established residential locations.\r\n\r\nThis spacious 4/5 bedroom home occupies a generous site, with a front driveway and garden together with a magnificent rear garden offering enormous potential. \r\n\r\nThe well-proportioned accommodation comprises, at ground floor level, an entrance hall, living room, family room, dining room, kitchen, shower room and bedroom/study. Upstairs there are four further bedrooms, one of which is en-suite, together with a main bathroom. Outside, the property benefits from a number of useful storage sheds.\r\n\r\nNumber 15 enjoys an enviable location directly overlooking a large park and beside a comprehensive range of services and amenities including shops, a coffee shop, public transport, playing pitches, schools, a church and Bon Secours Hospital. The property is also within a short walk of a number of  hotels, a cinema, sporting facilities, Ballyloughane Beach and Atlantic Technological University (ATU).\r\n\r\nThe combination of generous accommodation, a substantial site, excellent rear garden and superb location makes 15 Renmore Road an exciting opportunity to acquire and create a magnificent family home in one of Galway`s most established and highly regarded residential areas."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hall:\tCeiling coving & centrepiece, understairs storage\r\n\t\t\r\nLiving Room: 13'0\" (3.96m) x 12'0\" (3.66m) Stone Fireplace with electric fire, ceiling coving & centrepiece\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 1/Study: 8'2\" (2.49m) x 7'8\" (2.34m) Built-in wardrobe, whb.\r\n\t\t\r\nFamily Room: 12'7\" (3.84m) x 12'0\" (3.66m)\tFireplace, ceiling coving & centrepiece\r\n\t\t\r\nDining Room: 13'7\" (4.14m) x 9'0\" (2.74m) Laminate floor, ceiling coving, centrepiece\r\n\t\t\r\nShower Room: Shower, wc, whb\r\n\t\t\r\nKitchen: 14'7\" (4.45m) Max x 13'2\" (4.01m) Max\tFitted wall & floor units, built-in oven & hob, fridge/ freezer, stainless steel sink unit, tiled splashback, roof light, ceiling coving, sliding door to garden\r\n\t\t\r\nFIRST FLOOR\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\nLanding:\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2: 12'10\" (3.91m) Max x 11'5\" (3.48m) Max Built-in wardrobe & dressing table, ceiling coving\r\n\t\t\r\nEn-suite:\tShower, wc, whb, tiled floor & walls, window\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 3: 12'3\" (3.73m) x 8'10\" (2.69m) Built-in wardrobe & dressing table, whb\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 4: 12'6\" (3.81m) x 8'0\" (2.44m) Built-in wardrobe & dressing table\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 5: 12'5\" (3.78m) x 10'1\" (3.07m) Built-in wardrobe, vanity unit with whb, ceiling coving\r\n\t\t\r\nBathroom: Bath with overhead shower, wc, vanity unit with whb, hotpress\r\n\t\t\t\r\nPlease Note:\r\nMessrs. Mullery Auctioneers Ltd. for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of this property whose agents they are, give notice that:- (i) The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute, nor constitute part of, an offer or contract. (ii) All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. (iii) No person in the employment of Messrs. Mullery Auctioneers Ltd. has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property. (iv) We have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. (v) All measurements are approximate and photographs and maps provided are for guidance only. (vi) Where a Virtual Tour is provided, we do not accept any responsibility for the accuracy of the virtual tour measurement tool. Interested parties must confirm these measurements themselves by inspection or otherwise. (vii) Where a floorplan is provided please note the following; Whilst every attempt has been made to ensure the accuracy of these floorplans, any measurements, position of doors, windows etc are approximate and no responsibility is taken for any error, omission or mis-statement. These plans are provided for illustrative purposes only and should be used as such. These plans are for guidance only and must not be relied upon as a statement of fact. Attention is drawn to this important notice."
      },
